WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.880
You saved it. Then it was gone.

2
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.130
Shoebox. Keep it, and it comes back to you.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.240
Keep anything, from any app. Say why in a few words.

4
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.400
Or keep it right here.

5
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.950
Shoebox reads the day it's about, and brings it back before that day.

6
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.280
Flick up for the next one.

7
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.050
Pull down when you're done.

8
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.930
Tap to open it.

9
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:46.020
Forward an email, and keep just what matters.

10
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.660
Everything you're not done with, in one calm place.

11
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.310
On your phone. No account. No ads.

12
00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.000
Shoebox for iPhone. Join the beta.
